OL,3,GNEWSAFour monsters deflated due to
OL,4,Awindy weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour inflatable monsters installed in
OL,7,FNottingham city centre as part of a
OL,8,Ftrail have been deflated amid concerns
OL,9,Fabout the windy weather.
OL,11,FThe giant inflatables - called Groaner,
OL,12,FHowler, Berzerker, Snapper and Rombald
OL,13,FRock Giant - were positioned on
OL,14,Fbuildings including the Market Square
OL,15,FHouse, Binks Yard, Nottingham College
OL,16,Fand NG-One nightclub.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
