OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1793033753
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFour monsters deflated due to
OL,4,Awindy weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brightly coloured installations
OL,7,Fform part of a trail that was due to
OL,8,Fbegin on Monday and run until
OL,9,FHalloween, but the effects of Storm
OL,10,FBoelo - which battered much of the UK -
OL,11,Fmeans Howler is the sole monster still
OL,12,Fstanding.
OL,14,FOrganisers It's In Nottingham confirmed
OL,15,Fthe monsters had been temporarily
OL,16,Fdeflated and removed until weather
OL,17,Fconditions improve.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
